   "Returns the bit offset of a field relative to its containing struct.\n\nFor non [packed structs](https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.16.0/#packed-struct), this will always be divisible by `8`. For packed structs, non-byte-aligned fields will share a byte offset, but they will have different bit offsets.",
   :documentation-format :markdown,
