   "This function inserts a platform-specific debug trap instruction which causes debuggers to break there. Unlike for `@trap()`, execution may continue after this point if the program is resumed.\n\nThis function is only valid within function scope.",
   :documentation-format :markdown,
   :documentation-source :zls-langref,
